  sorry

/-- Helper for Lemma 17.9.7: finitely many local generators of the colimit sheaf can be lifted
simultaneously on one common smaller neighborhood and one common stage. -/
private theorem existsCommonOpenWithStageLiftedGenerators
    {U₀ : Opens X} (x : X) (hxU₀ : x ∈ U₀)
